INT. MINIATURE GOLF CLUBHOUSE - A PIRATE SHIP FOUNDERED IN PLASTER - DAY

A clubhouse built like a shipwreck. Fiberglass barnacles. A parrot animatronic that squawks on a timer. Scorecards pinned to a mast. The windows overlook a windmill hole where nobody is playing.

BARNABY QUINCE, 50s, tour-guide's moustache, pirate hat two sizes small, sits behind the counter practicing a speech to the empty room. Beside the register, ODALYS FERREIRA-LAWSON, 20s, mini-golf league champion, rolls a putter along the floorboards, bored.

BARNABY
(to the room)
Ahoy, ye mighty putters! Today we face the Kraken's Revenge, hole eighteen, par three...

ODALYS
Nobody is here, Barnaby.

BARNABY
(muttering to himself)
Practice makes plunder.

ODALYS
You say that to the parrot, too.

BARNABY
The parrot's a good listener.

The parrot squawks on cue.

PARROT (V.O.)
Pieces of eight! Pieces of eight!

BARNABY
See?

ODALYS
It's on a loop.

She sinks a putt into a coffee cup. Barnaby claps. She bows.

BARNABY
Ladies and gentlemen --

ODALYS
There's no ladies and gentlemen.

BARNABY
Ladies and gentleman.

ODALYS
Gentleperson.

BARNABY
(delighted)
Gentleperson! Excellent.

The door chimes. A family of six enters in matching shirts. They fill the clubhouse with sunburn and noise. Barnaby leaps up, hat tilting.

BARNABY (CONT'D)
(grandly, to all)
Welcome, brave souls! Who dares challenge the Kraken?

A small child points at Odalys.

CHILD
She's got a golf stick!

ODALYS
(to the child)
It's a putter.

BARNABY
(to the child)
It's a cutlass, my boy.

They speak at once.

BARNABY (CONT'D)
Eighteen holes of peril!

ODALYS
^Eighteen holes of boredom.

BARNABY
(hissing)
Odalys.

ODALYS
(whispering back)
What? It's honest.

The family cheers anyway. Barnaby sweeps the hat off, bows with a flourish. The hat tips off his head, rolls across the floor, and stops at the child's feet. The child puts it on.

BARNABY
(quietly, to himself)
Well, that's a first.

ODALYS
(to him, under her breath)
Don't get used to it. You'll want it back.

Barnaby hands out putters. Odalys slides the scorecards across the counter. The parrot squawks.

PARROT (V.O.)
Pieces of eight!

ODALYS
(deadpan)
And a mutiny.
